<title>SPAIN: Repsol adds 60 ptas to 5,900 as share offer starts.</title>
<headline>Repsol adds 60 ptas to 5,900 as share offer starts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spanish energy group Repsol started trade up 60 pesetas, or 1.03 percent, to 5,900 pesetas early on Monday as the privatisation of the State's last 10.0 percent stake in the firm began.</p>
<p>Today marks the start of the period for provisional share orders, which will run until April 21.</p>
<p>Stock market analysts expect the sale to be a resounding success.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
